## PREVENTION MEASURES — NOW IN PLACE

### 1. Backup Cron (installed 2026-03-02T16:03Z)

```
0 */4 * * * /opt/datachain-rope/scripts/anvil-state-backup.sh >> /opt/datachain-rope/anvil-state/backup.log 2>&1
