Every 4 hours, the script:
- Copies `state.json` to `backups/state-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.json.gz` (gzipped)
- Calls `anvil_dumpState` RPC and saves to `backups/rpc-dump-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.hex.gz`
- Deletes backups older than 7 days

